rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">旺季（4 月 1 日至 10 月 31 日）</span>：公园 6:00 至 21:00 开放，20:30 停止入园。园中园及小庭院 8:00 至 18:00 开放，17:30 停止进入。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">淡季（11 月 1 日至次年 3 月 31 日）</span>：公园 6:30 至 20:00 开放，19:30 停止入园。园中园及小庭院 8:30 至 17:00 开放，16:30 停止进入。</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br paragraph-JOTKXA paragraph-element br-paragraph-space\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 28px; font-size: 16px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">园中园景点（团城除外）逢周一关闭，法定节假日除外。</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"header-vfC6AV auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0px 0px 0px !important 0px; margin: 28px 0px 12px !important 0px;\">票价</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px; list-style: none; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin: 8px !important 0px 8px !important 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">旺季</span>：门票 10 元，联票 20 元。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">淡季</span>：门票 5 元，联票 15 元。</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"header-vfC6AV auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0px 0px 0px !important 0px; margin: 28px 0px 12px !important 0px;\">游览安全与公共秩序</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px; list-style: none; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin: 8px !important 0px 8px !important 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">按顺序排队购票入园，入园主动出示票证，避免拥挤。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">勿在湖里游泳、非开放冰面滑冰或行走，勿攀登山石。山道、台阶、码头等处慢行，儿童、行动不便老人需由家人陪同。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">未经批准，车辆不准入园。禁止使用大功率音响，不在路椅躺卧，不打闹、追逐、奔跑，不私自开展打球、踢球等活动。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">严禁组织非法集会，禁止打架斗殴、封建迷信、赌博等，不非法兜售商品或张贴广告。</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"header-vfC6AV auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0px 0px 0px !important 0px; margin: 28px 0px 12px !important 0px;\">物品携带限制</h3>\r\n<div class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br paragraph-JOTKXA paragraph-element br-paragraph-space\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 28px; font-size: 16px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">禁止携带枪支弹药、凶器、易燃易爆物品及动物进园。此外，出于维护秩序考虑，谢绝携带打光灯、遮光板、大量服装道具、营地车等易造成拥堵的商拍常用物品入园。</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"header-vfC6AV auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0px 0px 0px !important 0px; margin: 28px 0px 12px !important 0px;\">文物与环境维护</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px; list-style: none; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin: 8px !important 0px 0px 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">不损坏名胜古迹、古树名木与公共设施，不涂抹、刻画或张贴物品，未经许可，不开展随团摄像、影视拍摄等活动。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">爱护花草树木，不践踏草坪、攀折花果，不利用树木做健身运动。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">保持环境卫生，不随地吐痰、便溺或乱扔废弃物。</li>\r\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\">禁止在园内水域投网捕鱼或钓鱼。</li>\r\n</ul>","fdAnnex":null,"fdPicture":null,"fdTopping":null,"fdTopSorting":null,"fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdAuditStatus":"2","fdReadingTimes":"19822","fdIsPicture":"1","fdReviewedBy":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-21 16:17:20","fdUpPicture":null,"fdPictureWidth":550,"fdPictureHeight":360,"fdTitleTwo":null,"previousId":null,"nextId":null,"realname":null,"fdKeywordQuery":null,"fdSynopsis":"\r\n"},"timestamp":1791459062374}